{
  "id": "Jay.app.sub",
  "name": "Jay 订阅",
  "author": "@ygxdyz",
  "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/qq.png",
  "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
  "apps": [
    {
      "id": "bingrewards",
      "name": "Bing Rewards",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/bing.png",
      "keys": [
        "bingrewards_conf",
        "bingrewards_pass"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "bingrewards_conf",
          "name": "任务配置 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"per_run\":1}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "per_run=每轮执行账号数（1=轮换模式，多号错峰；0或留空=每轮全跑）。random_delay_max=启动随机延迟分钟数（默认25，手动测试嫌等可填0）。enable_search/enable_quiz/enable_activities 填 false 可关对应任务。留空走脚本内联默认"
        },
        {
          "id": "bingrewards_pass",
          "name": "密码表 (可选, JSON数组)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "[{\"username\":\"a@outlook.com\",\"password\":\"pass\",\"otpauth\":\"\"}]",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "备选登录方式，数组支持多号；有两步验证填 otpauth 完整链接。捕获到的账号优先，与此表不冲突"
        }
      ],
      "author": "@ygxdyz",
      "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/bing.png",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/bing.png"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lcky",
      "name": "立创开源签到",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/jlc.PNG",
      "keys": [
        "lcky_data",
        "lcky_pass",
        "lcky_pending_login"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "lcky_pass",
          "name": "密码表 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"17741931316\":\"密码1\",\"13666663315\":\"密码2\",\"13309896835\":\"密码3\"}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "JSON格式：{\"手机号\":\"密码\"}，多账号逗号分隔；账号掩码手机号（177****1316）自动匹配全号。Cookie过期时脚本自动密码登录续期，并种下绑定脚本自身设备指纹的30天免密令牌——密码不改则永久自动续期。密码只存手机本地QX存储，不经过任何第三方"
        }
      ],
      "author": "@ygxdyz",
      "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/jlc.PNG",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/jlc.PNG"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ftej",
      "name": "福田e家",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/ftej.png",
      "keys": [
        "ftej_data",
        "ftej_cap",
        "ftej_diag"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "ftej_diag",
          "name": "诊断命令（删号 / 清空）",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "DEL:17312349920",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "填命令→保存→点下方「运行诊断」或QX运行ftej_diag.js生效。① DEL:手机号=精准删除该账号档案（App单设备换号后旧号JWT已被踢死时用），多个号逗号分隔如 DEL:17312349920,13912345678 ② RESET=清空全部抓包数据重抓（之后App退出登录→短信验证码登录→进会员中心→再跑诊断） ③ 平时此键是诊断报告(JSON)，无需手改；要下命令时整个值只写命令本身"
        },
        {
          "id": "ftej_data",
          "name": "账号配置 (JSON)",
          "val": "",
          "type": "$text",
          "placeholder": "{\"cfg\":{\"pwdAccounts\":{\"13660643315\":\"密码\"}}}",
          "autoGrow": true,
          "desc": "pwdAccounts=密码账号表{\"手机号\":\"密码\"}，配了密码的账号走全自动（每日密码登录+💓心跳续命+签到三级降级）。ignoreAccounts=忽略清单（如 [\"17312349920\"]，捕获档案里有它但不想自动跑）。debug.hist/lastRun 是运行记录自动维护，别删整键、改完保留原结构"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "name": "▶ 运行诊断",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/ftej_diag.js"
        }
      ],
      "author": "@ygxdyz",
      "repo": "https://github.com/ygxdyz/Scripts",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/ftej.png",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/ftej.png"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "icons": [
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/qq.png",
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ygxdyz/Scripts/refs/heads/main/qq.png"
  ]
}
